flowchart TB
    subgraph Client[Client Device]
      B[Web Browser\nReact SPA]
    end

    subgraph Vercel[Vercel Static Hosting (configured)]
      FE[dist assets from Vite build]
    end

    subgraph Render[Render Web Service (configured)]
      API[FastAPI app\nuvicorn in Docker]
    end

    subgraph Data[Data Services]
      PG[(PostgreSQL 16)]
      RD[(Redis 7)]
    end

    subgraph External[External APIs]
      GOOG[Google OAuth]
      GROQ[Groq via langchain-groq]
      TAV[Tavily Search API]
      PRES[Presenton/Presentations API]
      IMG[Hugging Face / Unsplash (optional config)]
    end

    B <-->|HTTPS| FE
    B <-->|HTTPS + cookies| API
    API <-->|SQL| PG
    API <-->|Configured in compose/env| RD
    API <-->|OIDC flow| GOOG
    API <-->|LLM calls| GROQ
    API <-->|Web search| TAV
    API <-->|PPT generation| PRES
    API <-->|Image fetch/generation| IMG
